          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360046797191-How-to-resend-emails-in-Klaviyo#h_01JJW9J63PBQM327ZTR939EWGE",
          "text": "Limitations"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360046797191-How-to-resend-emails-in-Klaviyo#h_01HE0VG9XCD27PQ4ZC4YABD1KJ",
          "text": "Resending from a profile"
